stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Unproven
    Unproven --> Deployed: Trusted deployment collector records release
    Deployed --> Proving: Registered runner reserves attempt
    Proving --> Proven: Bound signed pass persists
    Proving --> Failed: Bound signed failure persists
    Proving --> Blocked: Bound signed prerequisite block persists
    Failed --> Proving: Runner reserves retry
    Blocked --> Proving: Runner reserves retry
    Proven --> Proving: Runner reserves revalidation
    Proven --> Deployed: Collector records another release or rollback
    Proving --> Deployed: Collector records another release or rollback
    Deployed --> Unproven: Latest release does not contain required merge
    %% never A builder can produce a trusted pass
    %% never A delayed prior attempt overrides a newer attempt
    %% never A receipt can be changed or deleted
